    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>7. Establish a longitudinal tracking system</strong>
      The 0.9% of students with a zero progression delta versus the ~50/50 improve/decline split suggests volatility in individual trajectories. A linked student-ID longitudinal study would enable causal analysis (rather than only cross-sectional correlations) and meaningfully improve the evidence base for future policy.
    </li>
  </ul>

